=================
wtp.zip
=================
This Package contains the product "We the People", a shareware
electronic book from LeftJustified Publiks(TM).  This product
requires Microsoft Windows(TM) version 3.1 or later.

We the People is an exploration of democracy through famous documents
related to democracy.  This product includes: a translation of the Magna
Carta, the American colonial Articles of Confederation, the Declaration
of Independence, The U.S.  Constitution, the U.N.  Declaration of Human
Rights, and excerpts from the constitutions of ten nations.

